# DIBAY Production Deploy

```text
git push origin main
  → Vercel Git Integration
  → ONE Production deployment
```

ONLY. Full detail: `docs/dibay-build-deploy-hard-lock.md`.

## DO NOT

- `vercel --prod` / `npx vercel deploy --prod` / Cursor CLI Production deploy
- dirty-tree Production (`gitDirty`) · Git FAIL 후 CLI override
- GHA `next build` · `ignoreBuildErrors: true` · Turbo build machine as Production substitute
- Dashboard Redeploy as cutover (env/incident/explicit rollback 제외)

Git Production FAIL = **FAILED** → 원인 고친 **새 commit** → `git push origin main` 1회.

Preview는 보조 확인용이지 Production 대체가 아니다.
